{"path":".agents/skills/vitadeck-smoke/SKILL.md","ref":"02d88881c71ebf1091332268ecbcd587dddafb01","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":1,"text":"---"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":2,"text":"name: vitadeck-smoke"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":3,"text":"description: Run VitaDeck's Dockerized Linux smoke test or refresh its CI golden screenshot. Use when changing rendering, theme, Deck App output, smoke fixtures, or when CI smoke fails."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":4,"text":"metadata:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":5,"text":"  internal: true"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":6,"text":"---"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":7,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":8,"text":"# VitaDeck smoke"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"99ed6cbb23775e678d737370eaaac58674735244","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238999,"line":10,"text":"The Linux smoke path is single-source: local runs and GitHub Actions both use `scripts/smoke-docker.sh` against the `smoke` stage from `Dockerfile`. CI builds that stage with BuildKit's GitHub Actions cache, then runs the script with `VITADECK_SMOKE_NO_BUILD=1`."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":12,"text":"## Test"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":14,"text":"From the repo root:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":16,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":17,"text":"scripts/smoke-docker.sh test"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":18,"text":"```"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":20,"text":"Completion criterion: the script finishes with `ctest` passing and leaves the inspected screenshot at `out-smoke/smoke_screenshot.png`."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":22,"text":"## Update Golden"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":24,"text":"After intentional visual changes:"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":26,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":27,"text":"scripts/smoke-docker.sh update-golden"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":28,"text":"```"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":30,"text":"Completion criterion: `tests/fixtures/smoke_golden.Linux.png` is updated by the Dockerized Linux harness. Review the resulting PNG before committing."},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":32,"text":"## Notes"},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"0d4477566365b7db665087cf440b6dc7326e6be5","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238000,"line":34,"text":"- The script keeps Linux `node_modules` and the pnpm store in Docker volumes, so it does not replace the host install."},{"sha":"99ed6cbb23775e678d737370eaaac58674735244","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1783238999,"line":35,"text":"- Use `VITADECK_SMOKE_NO_BUILD=1` only after a separate cached image build has loaded `vitadeck-smoke:latest`."}]}
